  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: type confusion with namespace nodes in xsl:number\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2019-5815.patch: reset the XPath context node\n       before calling the XPath iterators in libxslt/numbers.c, add\n       tests/docs/bug-218.xml, tests/general/bug-218.out,\n       tests/general/bug-218.xsl.\n     - CVE-2019-5815\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: use-after-free of the XPath context node\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-24855.patch: restore the XPath context node\n       after modifying it in libxslt/numbers.c, libxslt/templates.c and\n       libxslt/xsltutils.c.\n     - CVE-2025-24855\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: use-after-free in xsltApplyTemplates\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2021-30560.patch: stop deleting source document\n       nodes when applying templates in libxslt/transform.c.\n     - CVE-2021-30560\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: use-after-free of excluded namespace URIs\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2024-55549.patch: intern excluded namespace URIs in\n       the stylesheet dictionary instead of borrowing the namespace\n       definition's href in libxslt/xslt.c.\n     - CVE-2024-55549",
